<title>UK: Single Brent cargo kept - trade.</title>
<headline>Single Brent cargo kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The single Brent crude cargo which turned wet on Tuesday was kept before the five o'clock deadline by Stasco, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is due to load in the July 16-18 window.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
